        <activityName xml:lang="en">NOx retained, in SCR</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: NOx retained, in SCR
The assumed efficiency of the SCR is about 80 %. The waste includes the used catalysator.;
Synonyms: DeNOx; 
UUID: 06e130f9-c6ff-366e-901c-418667fb6f46
The module describes the operation of a Selective Catalytic Reduction DeNOx. The module includes the ammonia requirement and its transport as well as the disposal of the used catalysator.
Location: European conditions.
Technology: Average installed technology in the 1990s.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_06e130f9-c6ff-366e-901c-418667fb6f46.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
